### 🛣️ Quick Tips for Driving in Switzerland (Nov 2024)

| Tip | Why it matters |
|-----|-----------------|
| **Motorway vignette** – mandatory for all highways. Buy it at the airport or any fuel station (CHF 40 for a year). |
